sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as Client
  participant E as Edge
  participant A as API
  participant D as Database
  U->>C: Action
  C->>E: HTTPS request
  E->>A: Forward cache miss
  A->>D: Query / transaction
  D-->>A: Result
  A-->>E: Response
  E-->>C: HTTP response
  C-->>U: Render result
